Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:12.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Dragon Balls.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}When seven of these\Nmysterious balls are gathered{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.43,0:00:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}and the password recited,\NShenron appears and will grant any wish.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even now, Son Goku continues to\Nprotect Earth from evil.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:41.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Original Work, Story & Character Design\NAkira Toriyama (Shueisha "Jump comics")
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hee, hee hee!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:51.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Time to adventure!\NYou'll be hooked for sure!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.26,0:00:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The Demon Realm is full of mystery{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.47,0:00:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}DAIMA wonderland{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.51,0:01:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Whoopsie daisy!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.31,0:01:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even when your heart shrinks\NAnd you feel low{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.81,0:01:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Dreams are everywhere\NDon't worry about it{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.53,0:01:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Never give up{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.82,0:01:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Here comes a New Story{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.04,0:01:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Thousands of jabs and silly jokes{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.29,0:01:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}They're waitin' for you{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.13,0:01:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Jaan! Jaka jaan!\NThe fanfare of courage{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.63,0:01:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No-holds-barred battles\NThe excitement ain't stoppin'{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.73,0:01:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hey Shenron, grant my wish{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.94,0:01:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I wanna meet\NSomeone amazin' again tomorrow{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.12,0:02:06.04,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,OCEAN
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! I'm Majin Kuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.51,0:02:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here to take that Dragon Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.10,0:02:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.10,0:02:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.02,0:02:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am Tamagami Number One.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.36,0:02:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now you must fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.73,0:02:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hope you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.74,0:02:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,let us begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.57,0:03:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Say the pin number.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1022.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a Gendarmerie number.\NYou don't look like Gendarmerie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're family of Gendarmerie soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.75,0:03:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Very well. On with you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness. It looks like\Nno one has reported this plane yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.31,0:03:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This plane and pin number\Nare for Gendarmerie use.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.44,0:03:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Couldn't we go straight to\Nthe First Demon World?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:03:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.90,0:04:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But we can't gather\Nthe Dragon Balls that way, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.65,0:04:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To return to normal, first we need to\Ngo to the Second Demon World.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.45,0:04:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now you're talkin', Gliro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.33,0:04:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Glorio.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm worried about Dende.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I mentioned it before,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but they abducted him without killing him\Nbecause they have use for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.38,0:04:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nameks are quite valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.55,0:04:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then it's decided!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.69,0:04:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We were lucky to get our plane back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.03,0:04:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.07,0:04:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if we rescue Dende,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.99,0:04:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,if he is a baby, the Dragon Balls\Nwill be useless for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That stupid Kakarot may be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.95,0:04:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Using the Balls of this place\Nmight be the better way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your skin is really smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.42,0:04:59.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you think so, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.71,0:05:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I noticed it. It's so healthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.80,0:05:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's better if I don't bother\Ntrying to become an adult again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.97,0:05:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I could make you my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.39,0:05:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up! We're already married!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.85,0:05:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.44,0:05:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well I will!\NAre you asking to be pummeled?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.15,0:05:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You married a guy with really funny hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.28,0:05:26.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're one to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.11,0:05:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be ridiculous.\NThere's no way I'm staying as a brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.12,0:05:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then ask to be turned\Nback into an adult alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.33,0:05:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! We're turning back together!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.33,0:05:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I get it.\NYou like big boobs, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up! Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.42,0:05:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like he was right…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter! We're turning back\Ninto adults and going back to Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.91,0:06:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh! So this is the Second Demon World!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.63,0:07:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's them! They're already that far!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.72,0:07:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Supreme Kai-sama,\Nyou ain't been here in a long time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.72,0:07:19.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, it's been quite long.\NThis brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.81,0:07:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't we going a little fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.23,0:07:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The air here isn't heavy,\Nso we can fly fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Plus the Tamagami is nearby,\Nso we should be there in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell me, are there still krakens here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.83,0:07:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, of course. There's a ton of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.91,0:07:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What're those… whatever you called 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.75,0:07:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Krakens. They're gigantic sea monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If you accidentally fly too low,\Nthey can attack and swallow you whole.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.34,0:07:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've heard of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.43,0:08:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They say those monsters are so huge\Nthey're like moving islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.23,0:08:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They've got massive claws\Nand even if you hit them with bombs…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.94,0:08:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.61,0:08:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fight back already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.71,0:08:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What're you doin'?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not used to this so it's difficult!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.17,0:08:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,From the side!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.56,0:08:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just do something already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.15,0:08:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ow! I bit my tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.77,0:08:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Open the rear door!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.19,0:08:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,G-Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.45,0:08:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.76,0:09:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're goin' nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.68,0:09:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Increase the speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.15,0:09:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why you…!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:42.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.49,0:09:44.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That little brat\Ntook them down by himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.91,0:09:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's stronger than we imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather all Gendarmerie to the First\NDemon World before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:10:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He did it! He really is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.91,0:10:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O-Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.01,0:10:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-Holy moly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.80,0:10:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.89,0:10:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Panzy-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.81,0:10:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.53,0:10:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Panzy-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.99,0:11:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Panzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.74,0:11:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.71,0:11:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Panzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.61,0:11:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Panzy-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.41,0:11:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my goodness! The Dragon Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.38,0:11:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.50,0:11:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.55,0:12:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Great job, Panzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Panzy-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Blast it!\NIf only the kraken had eaten them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.65,0:12:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What now? Shall we take a break\Nand wait for Vegeta-san and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.82,0:12:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right.\NThat sounds like a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.04,0:12:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I messed up. I should've left\Nat least one plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.54,0:12:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The planet where the Nameks used to live\Nshould be floating nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.67,0:12:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's wait there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.63,0:12:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! So that's Piccolo's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.48,0:12:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.68,0:13:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow! It looks just like Planet Namek did!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.85,0:13:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They must have taken trees with them\Nto rebuild their new home like here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can imagine\Nit was quite an effort to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.69,0:13:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But Frieza destroyed all of it.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.33,0:13:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man I'm starvin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.87,0:13:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Losin' all our food\Nand Manpuku Dumplin's sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.71,0:14:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Deal with it.\NIt hasn't been that long since breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.09,0:14:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come to think of it…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.67,0:14:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I still have those Revive Bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're supposed to restore your stamina,\Nbut will they fill your belly, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not how they work.\NThey won't fill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got three. Anyone want one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.19,0:14:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That tastes gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.45,0:14:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.16,0:14:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I feel more energetic\Nand my belly feels a little full, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like no one lives here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No one would live here\Nwith nothing but dirty water and trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.51,0:14:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing's changed since the Nameks left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.05,0:14:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.51,0:14:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? Looks like Vegeta\Nand the others made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.81,0:14:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring 'em here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.44,0:15:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How can he tell they're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.44,0:15:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He can sense them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.28,0:15:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He really is quite strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.20,0:15:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow. This place is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't feel like a demon world at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.04,0:15:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You must have missed this place, Piccolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.75,0:15:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't know.\NIt was my father who lived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:24.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, someone's coming this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.59,0:15:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.71,0:15:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph. It's Kakarot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's Goku.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.01,0:15:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kakarot and Goku are the same person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.55,0:15:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So he has two names?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.26,0:15:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not that I really care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.35,0:15:40.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's saying something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.94,0:15:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Open the door for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.53,0:15:53.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Fly higher!\NOne of those monsters'll get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.61,0:15:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.24,0:15:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.95,0:16:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. They're in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.25,0:16:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at you, scared of a little monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.07,0:16:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's that big?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.03,0:16:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See? I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.90,0:16:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We ain't strong enough for that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, Hybis!\NWhy weren't you looking out for that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.95,0:16:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph. This is my first time here.\NDon't blame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.62,0:16:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you came to warn us about the monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.38,0:16:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nah. We lost our plane to that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.55,0:16:55.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're waitin' for you guys\Nto give us a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.14,0:16:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So it's about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.28,0:17:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I lose. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.45,0:17:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. I couldn't beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.16,0:17:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.54,0:17:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.67,0:17:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No one's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.67,0:17:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's strange.\NI thought I heard a commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so disappointed in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.39,0:17:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-Huh?\N-I'm firing you. You're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.18,0:17:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.35,0:17:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That thing was just too strong.\NI'm pretty strong, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.31,0:17:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a good singer and I'm pretty fast.\NI can be valuable if you send me shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.66,0:18:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think, Piccolo?\NYou must have missed this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.09,0:18:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told Bulma the same thing.\NI was born after my father escaped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, now that you mention it…\NThis place feels familiar and pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.77,0:18:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It must have been a difficult decision\Nto leave here…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.35,0:18:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Supreme Demon Kings\Nwere always self-serving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.15,0:18:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nameks have many abilities,\Nso they were regarded as quite valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.90,0:18:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They were treated as\Nlittle more than slaves…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.33,0:18:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're from the Second Demon World, too,\Naren't you, Nahare?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.20,0:18:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. Somewhere far from here, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.79,0:18:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.50,0:18:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that? What's Nahare?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Supreme Kai-sama's real name.\NApparently it's Nahare.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.42,0:19:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh. So you have a real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.43,0:19:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.14,0:19:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you're one of the ones\Nwho escaped the Demon Realm, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.10,0:19:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a long story, but may I tell it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.98,0:19:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, we don't need to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.36,0:19:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh come on. Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.32,0:19:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, to make it short…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.95,0:19:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Long ago, the good Supreme Demon King of\Nthat age sought to expand the Demon Realm.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.91,0:19:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}He ordered the powerful Super Majin Rymus\Nto create the universe.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.42,0:19:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rymus?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.54,0:19:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Yes. They're still\Nthe highest authority in the universe.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.26,0:19:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.13,0:19:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Various universes were created,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.05,0:19:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}and many Majin began\Nmoving to those universes.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.39,0:19:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Rymus-sama then chose a select few\Nfrom among us Glinds{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.19,0:19:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}and sent us out to monitor the universes\Nas Supreme Kais.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.15,0:20:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Then every being in the universe\Nis a descendant of the Majin?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.86,0:20:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.95,0:20:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For example, Earthlings and Saiyans were\Nborn after your universe was created.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Many Glind ancestors\Nmoved to a planet near Rymus-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.13,0:20:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Back then, Warp-sama was freely used\Nto travel between realms.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.22,0:20:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Abura, Dabura's predecessor, feared the\Npotential threat of beings from outside,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.52,0:20:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}and limited the use of Warp-sama.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.31,0:20:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Were you still in the Demon Realm then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.69,0:20:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But most of the remaining Glinds
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.45,0:20:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,revolted against Abura's cruel ways\Nand escaped to the outside universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was chosen as Supreme Kai after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.33,0:20:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you know?\NThe Supreme Kais are born from trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.17,0:20:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! Is that true?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.21,0:21:03.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We Glinds are born from five Glind Trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.30,0:21:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But all of the trees died.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}With no reason to stay here, it led to\Nour emigration to the universe.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.81,0:21:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, the Glinds are eventually\Ngoing to die out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.94,0:21:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.23,0:21:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.65,0:21:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you're a Glind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.36,0:21:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You seem pretty smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.53,0:21:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just like Degesu and Arinsu\Nfrom the Supreme Demon King's palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.83,0:21:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're both Nahare's siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.16,0:21:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You three must have fought over snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.58,0:21:38.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.79,0:21:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those two may be Glinds,\Nbut they're not really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.88,0:21:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.72,0:21:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Supreme Kai-sama,\Ndon't you want to visit your home planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.35,0:21:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's okay.\NThere's nothing there anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.64,0:21:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We should move on instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.60,0:21:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There you have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.23,0:22:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We need to hurry to the next Tamagami\Nand get the Dragon Ball from it, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.03,0:22:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, it's cramped in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.74,0:22:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.07,0:22:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's your name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.12,0:22:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Glorio.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We should have Glorio pilot us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.41,0:22:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that a jab against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.33,0:22:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No. This is your first time here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.88,0:22:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then you can pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.73,0:22:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Holding out my hand{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.40,0:22:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Up to the sky{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.20,0:22:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The moment is ours{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.37,0:22:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Make a miracle happen{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.87,0:23:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Like a bird with open wings we fly{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.13,0:23:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Picking up{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Those pieces of hope{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.30,0:23:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}There's no giving up{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.81,0:23:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Go as far as we can{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.15,0:23:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I got you by my side{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.77,0:23:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Run, run, run{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.86,0:23:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Over the mountain we go{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.45,0:23:35.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I hear it always\NYour voice in my heart{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.28,0:23:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"You know that we're never alone"{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.66,0:23:45.54,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,LEGEND
